        "the Aliens Appeals Board – the judicial appeal body against decisions by the Aliens Office (see paragraph 52 below) –"@en,
        "the Aliens Appeals Board’s judgment of 20 October 2016"@en .

doc:aliensOffice a echr:DomesticAuthority,
        echr:Party ;
    rdfs:label "Aliens Office"@en ;
    echr:hasAuthorityKind echr:AuthorityAdministrative ;
    echr:hasAuthorityName "Aliens Office"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "the Aliens Office issued new decisions, dated 10 October 2016, refusing to grant the visas; however, it provided the same reasons as in the previous refusals."^^xsd:string,
